  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<div>The attribute table included in the dataset provides some limited metadata information that is specific to each lake. This includes the:</div><div><ul><li>survey year</li><li>survey method</li><li>original map scale</li></ul></div><div>This dataset should be used for discovery of Bathymetry data. It provides no bathymetric information, but allows users to discover where bathymetry data exists and in what format.<br />&nbsp;</div><div>To access bathymetry data, see the following products:<br />&nbsp;</div><div><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://geohub.lio.gov.on.ca/datasets/mnrf::bathymetry-line/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Bathymetry Line</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://geohub.lio.gov.on.ca/datasets/mnrf::bathymetry-point/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Bathymetry Point</a></li><li><a target='_blank' href='https://geohub.lio.gov.on.ca/datasets/mnrf::historic-bathymetry-maps-1/about' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Historic Bathymetry Maps</a></li></ul></div><div><strong>Additional Documentation</strong></div><div><ul><li><a target='_blank' href='https://www.publicdocs.mnr.gov.on.ca/mirb/Bathymetry-UserGuide-EN.docx' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Bathymetry User Guide (Word)</a></li></ul></div><div><strong>Status</strong></div><div>On going: data is being continually updated<br />&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Maintenance and Update Frequency</strong></div><div>As needed: data is updated as deemed necessary<br />&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Contact</strong></div><div>Ontario Ministry of Natural Resources - GeospatialOntario, <a href='mailto:geospatial@ontario.ca' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>geospatial@ontario.ca</a></div>"
